Chapter: ChapterPaginationWrongCount

 The chapter spans two files but both pages claim "of 5". This is the
 drift that actually happened: the X86-64 code generator grew from ten
 files to thirteen and kept declaring "of 10", with three pages carrying
 no marker at all. Nothing checked, so nothing noticed.

